          "sections": [
            {
              "label": "Rule",
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Amount owed = assessed fines + running fines of loans still out (days overdue × €0.50, capped at the book's price) + lost-book fees + usage fees, minus what is paid or waived. Checked every morning and whenever a charge is made. Blocked: no new loans or reservations."
